<title>INDONESIA: Indofood to pay dividend of 47 rph.</title>
<headline>Indofood to pay dividend of 47 rph.</headline>
<dateline>JAKARTA 1997-06-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Indonesia's largest noodle maker PT Indofood Sukses Makmur on Tuesday won shareholder approval to pay 1996 dividend of 47 rupiah per share, the company said.</p>
<p>It said in statement that its shareholders also approved increasing authorised capital to three trillion rupiah from one trillion rupiah in anticipation of further expansion.</p>
<p>-- Jakarta newsroom +6221 384-6364</p>
</text>
